@Gclopes.FinVault.PayrollAnalysis_HostAddress = http://localhost:7002

### Import a parsed payslip (as sent by the PdfParser pipeline)
POST {{Gclopes.FinVault.PayrollAnalysis_HostAddress}}/api/payroll-analysis/imports
Content-Type: application/json

