### Re-sending the same sourceDocumentId is idempotent (returns the existing import, no duplicate)

### List all imported payslips
GET {{Gclopes.FinVault.PayrollAnalysis_HostAddress}}/api/payroll-analysis/imports
Accept: application/json

### Get a specific import by its source document id
GET {{Gclopes.FinVault.PayrollAnalysis_HostAddress}}/api/payroll-analysis/imports/dc06c4e8-0992-4aad-9bb3-fd3bf9c07207
Accept: application/json
